/**
\namespace AppCUI
\brief Root namespace of the AppCUI framework (`#include <AppCUI.hpp>`).

Besides the namespaces below, it defines the fixed-size integer aliases used everywhere in the API
(`uint8` ... `uint64`, `int8` ... `int64`, `char8`, `char16`).

\namespace AppCUI::StdIncludes
\brief Standard library names (`string_view`, `u16string_view`, `unique_ptr`, `vector`, `optional`, ...) imported into
the `AppCUI` namespace.

\namespace AppCUI::Application
\brief Application lifetime: initialization (Init, InitializationData), the event loop (Run), desktop windows
(AddWindow, ArrangeWindows), menus, themes, settings (`<executable>.ini`) and custom frontends.

\namespace AppCUI::Controls
\brief Every visual element: windows, buttons, text fields, lists, trees, grids, splitters, tabs, menus and the base
Control class. Controls are created through the AppCUI::Controls::Factory classes and positioned with layout strings.

\namespace AppCUI::Controls::Factory
\brief Creation helpers: `Factory::<Control>::Create(parent, ..., layout, ...)` creates a control and adds it to its
parent (returning a non-owning Reference) or returns an owning Pointer when no parent is given.

\namespace AppCUI::Controls::Handlers
\brief Event handlers that can be attached to a control (`control->Handlers()->OnXXX = ...`) instead of deriving a new
control class: either a pointer to an object that implements the matching `On...Interface` or a plain function (a
lambda without captures).

\namespace AppCUI::Graphics
\brief Drawing: colors, characters, the Renderer used by Control::Paint, canvases, images, rectangles, clipping,
special characters (box drawing, arrows, ...), code pages and text formatting.

\namespace AppCUI::Graphics::ProgressStatus
\brief A modal progress window for long operations.

\namespace AppCUI::Input
\brief Keyboard and mouse input: key codes and modifiers (Key), mouse buttons and wheel, key bindings, key maps and
keyboard modifier profiles (ModifierMap).

\namespace AppCUI::Utils
\brief General purpose utilities: strings (String, LocalString, UnicodeStringBuilder, FixSizeString), buffers
(Buffer, BufferView), INI files (IniObject), number formatting and parsing, smart references (Reference, Pointer),
properties (PropertiesInterface) and key helpers (KeyUtils).

\namespace AppCUI::Utils::Number
\brief Parsing of numbers from strings (decimal, hexadecimal, ...).

\namespace AppCUI::OS
\brief Operating system services: files (File, MemoryFile, DataObject), the clipboard, dynamic libraries, date / time
and special folders.

\namespace AppCUI::Dialogs
\brief Ready made modal dialogs: message boxes, open / save file dialogs, the windows manager and the theme editor.

\namespace AppCUI::Log
\brief Logging of AppCUI (and application) messages to a file, to stdout / stderr or to the debugger.

\namespace AppCUI::Endian
\brief Byte order helpers: byte swapping and conversions between the host order and little / big endian.
*/
